reason of the loss of the external amenity space for the retained residential
occupiers of the site, would fail to provide suitable amenity provision, to the
detriment of the quality of living conditions for those residential occupiers, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;
mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;contrary
to Policies D3.D(7) of The London Plan (2021) and Policy DM27 of the Harrow
Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
